  "field_building_orgs": {
    "$comment": [
      "Orgs whose roles must NOT inherit an agenda, because the org does not have one. A MATS or",
      "Constellation fellow works on whichever agenda their mentor works on; tagging the cohort to",
      "a single agenda would be a fabrication, and tagging it to none would bury the single most",
      "useful entry point in the dataset.",
      "",
      "These roles get agenda_id: null AND cross_agenda: true, so browse can surface them under",
      "every agenda with the label 'open to any agenda, placement depends on your mentor'."
    ],
